d list is valid.", "Optionally return chronology.events for clear event/date pairs already stated verbatim in the final title, hook, or body. Each event has dateText copied exactly, eventText copied as a short exact clause that includes that date, and anchor {field:'title'|'hook'|'body', sentenceIndex?}; body uses its zero-based sentence index. Do not add background events or article publication/revision/retrieval dates. Omit uncertain or unsupported dates and omit chronology when fewer than two clear events remain. This optional field is ignored if invalid and must not alter or lengthen the card.", "Optionally return up to two locations already named explicitly in the final title, hook, or body. Each has name, articleTitle (an exact English Wikipedia article title for that place), and anchor {field:'title'|'hook'|'body', sentenceIndex?}; body uses its zero-based sentence index. Do not infer places from topic paths or background sources, and do not return a country solely used to orient a named city. Omit ambiguous places. This optional field is ignored if invalid and must not alter or lengthen the card."],
